*.tsbuildinfo
dist
# Claude Code local (per-user) settings — not shared
.claude/settings.local.json

# Local session handoff scratch — deliberately NOT tracked. It would only mirror
# git/gh/Jira and drift out of date, which is what PDEV-7334 cleaned up. Durable
# facts belong in CLAUDE.md, the /sdk skills, or Jira.
/status.md

# Coverage output from `npm run test:coverage` (which the release gate in
# .claude/skills/sdk-release Phase 1 mandates). Generated, so never committed —
# and because biome.json sets `vcs.useIgnoreFile: true`, ignoring it here is also
# what keeps `biome check .` from linting ~700 lines of generated istanbul JS and
# failing the lint gate right after the release gate told you to produce it.
/coverage/
